    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>UnlockHint</name>
      <id>68</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the received goods for sale and consumption.
Select it if the goods quality is confirmed.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تصمیم گرفته شد کالای دریافتی برای فروش و مصرف استفاده شود.
اگر کیفیت کالا تأیید شده است، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Принято решение использовать поступивший товар для продажи и потребления.
Уместно выбирать, если качество товара подтверждено.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Gelen ürünün satış ve tüketim için kullanılmasına karar verildi. 
 Ürünün kalitesi onaylandığında seçilmesi uygundur.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the received goods for sale and consumption.
Select it if the goods quality is confirmed.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the received goods for sale and consumption.
Select it if the goods quality is confirmed.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the received goods for sale and consumption.
Select it if the goods quality is confirmed.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>UnlockHintExtendedTooltip</name>
