    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintToMakeDamage</name>
      <id>56</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the item as an item of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Create the &quot;Stock quality change&quot; document based on the certificate.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تصمیم گرفته شد قلم به‌عنوان قلمی با کیفیت متفاوت استفاده شود.
اگر در کنترل کیفیت انحراف یا نقص کیفی شناسایی شد، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.
سند «تغییر کیفیت موجودی» را بر اساس گواهی ایجاد کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Принято решение использовать товар как номенклатуру другого качества.
Уместно выбирать, если при контроле выявлены отклонения по качеству, дефекты.
На основании акта необходимо оформить документ &quot;Порча товаров&quot;.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Ürünün farklı kalitede bir öğe olarak kullanılmasına karar verildi. 
 Kontrolde kalite sapmaları, kusurlar tespit edildiğinde seçilmesi uygundur. 
 Tutanağa dayanarak &quot;Ürün stok kalite değişikliği &quot; belgesinin düzenlenmesi gerekir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the item as an item of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Create the &quot;Stock quality change&quot; document based on the certificate.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the item as an item of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Create the &quot;Stock quality change&quot; document based on the certificate.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>It was decided to use the item as an item of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Create the &quot;Stock quality change&quot; document based on the certificate.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
