      </contextMenu>
      <type>RadioButtonField</type>
      <editMode>Enter</editMode>
      <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
      <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
      <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
        <choiceList>
          <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
            <value>Enum.ActionsOnGoodsInQualityControlCertificate.EnumValue.RegisterReturn</value>
          </value>
        </choiceList>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintToMakeReturn</name>
      <id>59</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>It was decided to return the goods to the vendor and register the return documents.
Select it for low-quality goods based on the results of vendor approval.
Next, create the &quot;Return of goods to vendor&quot; document.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تصمیم گرفته شد کالا به فروشنده مرجوع و اسناد مرجوعی ثبت شود.
برای کالای بی‌کیفیت بر اساس نتایج تأیید فروشنده، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.
سپس سند «مرجوعی کالا به فروشنده» را ایجاد کنید.
محدودیت‌های استفاده از کالا برداشته می‌شود؛ انبارداری جداگانه کالای مرجوعی باید خارج از سیستم سازمان‌دهی شود.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Принято решение о возврате товара поставщику с оформлением документов возврата.
Уместно выбирать, для некачественных товаров, по результатам согласования с поставщиком.
Далее штатно оформляется документ &quot;Возврат товаров поставщику&quot;.
Снимаются ограничения на использование товара, отдельное складирование возвращаемых товаров необходимо организовать вне системы.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Ürünün tedarikçiye iade edilmesine ve iade belgelerinin düzenlenmesine karar verildi. 
 Tedarikçiyle yapılan mutabakat sonuçlarına göre, kalitesiz ürünler için seçilmesi uygundur. 
 Standart prosedürde &quot;Tedarikçiye Ürün İadesi&quot; belgesi düzenlenir. 
 Ürünün kullanımındaki kısıtlamalar kaldırılır, iade edilen ürünlerin ayrı bir yerde depolanması sistem dışında organize edilmelidir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>It was decided to return the goods to the vendor and register the return documents.
Select it for low-quality goods based on the results of vendor approval.
Next, create the &quot;Return of goods to vendor&quot; document.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>It was decided to return the goods to the vendor and register the return documents.
Select it for low-quality goods based on the results of vendor approval.
Next, create the &quot;Return of goods to vendor&quot; document.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>It was decided to return the goods to the vendor and register the return documents.
Select it for low-quality goods based on the results of vendor approval.
Next, create the &quot;Return of goods to vendor&quot; document.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>HintToMakeReturnExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>61</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>HintToMakeReturnContextMenu</name>
        <id>60</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <type>Label</type>
      <width>60</width>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
        <color>Style.HelpText</color>
      </textColor>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
