        </choiceList>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintToMakeMove</name>
      <id>62</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>It was decided to transfer the received goods to an isolated warehouse.
Select it for low-quality goods, decisions on which will be made later.
Create the &quot;Goods transfer&quot; document based on the certificate.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تصمیم گرفته شد کالای دریافتی به انبار قرنطینه منتقل شود.
برای کالای بی‌کیفیتی که درباره آن بعداً تصمیم‌گیری خواهد شد، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.
سند «انتقال کالا» را بر اساس گواهی ایجاد کنید.
محدودیت‌های استفاده از کالا برداشته می‌شود؛ انبارداری جداگانه کالای مرجوعی باید خارج از سیستم سازمان‌دهی شود.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Принято решение о перемещении поступившего товара на изолированный склад.
Уместно выбирать, для некачественных товаров, решения по которым будут приняты позже.
На основании акта необходимо оформить документ &quot;Перемещение товаров&quot;.
Снимаются ограничения на использование товара, отдельное складирование возвращаемых товаров необходимо организовать вне системы.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Gelen ürünün izole bir ambara aktarılmasına karar verildi. 
 Hakkında daha sonra karar verilecek olan kalitesiz ürünler için seçilmesi uygundur. 
 Tutanağa dayanarak &quot;Ürün Transferi&quot; belgesinin düzenlenmesi gerekir. 
 Ürünün kullanımındaki kısıtlamalar kaldırılır, iade edilen ürünlerin ayrı bir yerde depolanması sistem dışında organize edilmelidir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>It was decided to transfer the received goods to an isolated warehouse.
Select it for low-quality goods, decisions on which will be made later.
Create the &quot;Goods transfer&quot; document based on the certificate.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>It was decided to transfer the received goods to an isolated warehouse.
Select it for low-quality goods, decisions on which will be made later.
Create the &quot;Goods transfer&quot; document based on the certificate.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>It was decided to transfer the received goods to an isolated warehouse.
Select it for low-quality goods, decisions on which will be made later.
Create the &quot;Goods transfer&quot; document based on the certificate.
Restrictions on using goods are removed, separate warehousing of returned goods must be organized outside the system.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>HintToMakeMoveExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>64</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>HintToMakeMoveContextMenu</name>
        <id>63</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <type>Label</type>
      <width>60</width>
      <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
        <color>Style.HelpText</color>
      </textColor>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
