    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintToMakeWriteOff</name>
      <id>65</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>It was decided to write off the received goods in the warehouse.
You can select it for low-quality goods, as well as destroyed samples.
Next, create the &quot;Stock shortage recognition&quot; document.
If you do not use warehouse management upon recording surpluses/shortages, specify the controlled lot in the document.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>تصمیم گرفته شد کالای دریافتی در انبار اسقاط شود.
می‌توانید این گزینه را برای کالای بی‌کیفیت و نیز نمونه‌های معدوم‌شده انتخاب کنید.
سپس سند «شناسایی کسری موجودی» را ایجاد کنید.
اگر هنگام ثبت مازاد/کسری از مدیریت انبار استفاده نمی‌کنید، لات کنترل‌شده را در سند مشخص کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Принято решение списать поступивший товар на складе.
Уместно выбирать, для некачественных товаров, а также разрушенных образцов.
Далее штатно оформляется документ &quot;Списание недостач товаров&quot;.
При не ордерном отражении излишков/недостач в документе необходимо указать контролируемую партию.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Gelen ürünün ambarda gider yazılmasına karar verildi. 
 Kalitesiz ürünler ve ayrıca yok edilen numuneler için seçilmesi uygundur. 
Standart prosedürde &quot;Ürün Eksiği Giderme&quot; belgesi düzenlenir. 
 Fazlalıkların/eksikliklerin sipariş bazlı olmayan yansımasında belgede kontrol edilen lotun belirtilmesi gerekir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>It was decided to write off the received goods in the warehouse.
You can select it for low-quality goods, as well as destroyed samples.
Next, create the &quot;Stock shortage recognition&quot; document.
If you do not use warehouse management upon recording surpluses/shortages, specify the controlled lot in the document.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>It was decided to write off the received goods in the warehouse.
You can select it for low-quality goods, as well as destroyed samples.
Next, create the &quot;Stock shortage recognition&quot; document.
If you do not use warehouse management upon recording surpluses/shortages, specify the controlled lot in the document.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>It was decided to write off the received goods in the warehouse.
You can select it for low-quality goods, as well as destroyed samples.
Next, create the &quot;Stock shortage recognition&quot; document.
If you do not use warehouse management upon recording surpluses/shortages, specify the controlled lot in the document.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
