        <name>SelectValueChangeQualityContextMenu</name>
        <id>23</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <type>RadioButtonField</type>
      <editMode>Enter</editMode>
      <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
      <headerHorizontalAlign>Left</headerHorizontalAlign>
      <showInFooter>true</showInFooter>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:RadioButtonsFieldExtInfo">
        <choiceList>
          <value xsi:type="core:ReferenceValue">
            <value>Enum.ActionsOnGoodsInQualityControlCertificate.EnumValue.ChangeQuality</value>
          </value>
        </choiceList>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintToChangeQuality</name>
      <id>47</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>The goods are accepted into the warehouse as items of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt (available when using warehouse management).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>کالا به‌عنوان اقلامی با کیفیت متفاوت در انبار پذیرفته می‌شود.
اگر در کنترل کیفیت انحراف یا نقص کیفی شناسایی شد، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.
سپس گزارش مغایرت ایجاد کنید. اگر از گزارش‌های مغایرت استفاده نمی‌شود، اسناد مبدأ دریافت کالا را اصلاح کنید (هنگام استفاده از مدیریت انبار در دسترس است).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Товар принимается на склад как номенклатура другого качества.
Уместно выбирать, если при контроле выявлены отклонения по качеству, дефекты.
Далее штатно оформляется &quot;Акт о расхождениях&quot;, если это не предусмотрено, необходимо исправить первичные документы поступления товара (доступно, при ордерной схеме приемки).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Ürün, farklı kalitede bir öğe olarak ambara kabul edilir. 
 Kontrolde kalite sapmaları, kusurlar tespit edildiğinde seçilmesi uygundur. 
 Standart prosedürde &quot;Tutarsızlık Tutanağı&quot; düzenlenir, eğer bu öngörülmemişse, ürüne ait giriş kaynak belgelerinin düzeltilmesi gerekir (emir bazlı giriş şemasında geçerlidir).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>The goods are accepted into the warehouse as items of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt (available when using warehouse management).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>The goods are accepted into the warehouse as items of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt (available when using warehouse management).</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>The goods are accepted into the warehouse as items of different quality.
Select it if quality variances or defects are detected during quality control.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt (available when using warehouse management).</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>HintToChangeQualityExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>49</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
