    </items>
    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintToReturnToSupplier</name>
      <id>50</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse and is immediately returned to the vendor.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>کالا در انبار پذیرفته نمی‌شود و بلافاصله به فروشنده مرجوع می‌شود.
برای کالای بی‌کیفیت یا کالای دارای انحراف کیفی، هنگامی که رویه رد در زمان پذیرش و مرجوعی با فروشنده توافق شده است، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.
سپس گزارش مغایرت ایجاد کنید. اگر از گزارش‌های مغایرت استفاده نمی‌شود، اسناد مبدأ دریافت کالا را اصلاح کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Товар не принимается на склад и немедленно возвращается поставщику.
Уместно выбирать для некачественных товаров, либо с отклонениями по качеству, когда порядок отбраковки при приемке и возврата согласован с поставщиком.
Далее штатно оформляется &quot;Акт о расхождениях&quot;, если это не предусмотрено, необходимо исправить первичные документы поступления товара.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Mal ambara kabul edilmez ve derhal tedarikçiye iade edilir. 
 Kalitesiz mallar veya girişteki reddetme ve iade prosedürü tedarikçiyle mutabık kalınmış kalite sapmalı mallar için seçilmesi uygundur. 
 Standart prosedürde &quot;Tutarsızlık Tutanağı&quot; düzenlenir, eğer bu öngörülmemişse, mala ait giriş kaynak belgelerinin düzeltilmesi gerekir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse and is immediately returned to the vendor.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse and is immediately returned to the vendor.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse and is immediately returned to the vendor.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>HintToReturnToSupplierExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>52</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
