    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>HintDonTReceiveGoods</name>
      <id>53</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse, are destroyed and are considered undelivered.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>کالا در انبار پذیرفته نمی‌شود، معدوم می‌شود و تحویل‌نشده تلقی می‌شود.
برای کالای بی‌کیفیت یا کالای دارای انحراف کیفی، هنگامی که رویه رد در زمان پذیرش و مرجوعی با فروشنده توافق شده است، این گزینه را انتخاب کنید.
سپس گزارش مغایرت ایجاد کنید. اگر از گزارش‌های مغایرت استفاده نمی‌شود، اسناد مبدأ دریافت کالا را اصلاح کنید.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Товар не принимается на склад, уничтожается и считается недопоставленным.
Уместно выбирать для некачественных товаров, либо с отклонениями по качеству, когда такой порядок отбраковки при приемке согласован с поставщиком.
Далее штатно оформляется &quot;Акт о расхождениях&quot;, если это не предусмотрено, необходимо исправить первичные документы поступления товара.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Ürün ambara kabul edilmez, imha edilir ve eksik teslim edilmiş sayılır.
  Kalitesiz ürünler veya girişteki bu tür bir reddetme prosedürü tedarikçiyle mutabık kalınmış kalite sapmalı ürünler için seçilmesi uygundur. 
 Standart prosedürde &quot;Tutarsızlık Tutanağı&quot; düzenlenir, eğer bu öngörülmemişse, ürüne ait giriş kaynak belgelerinin düzeltilmesi gerekir.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse, are destroyed and are considered undelivered.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse, are destroyed and are considered undelivered.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>The goods are not accepted into the warehouse, are destroyed and are considered undelivered.
Select it for low-quality goods or goods with quality variances, when the procedure of rejection during acceptance and return is agreed with the vendor.
Next, create a discrepancy report. If discrepancy reports are not used, correct the source documents of goods receipt.</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
